{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-1","title":"John 8:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Christ delivers the woman taken in adultery. 12 He declares himself the light of the world, and justifies his doctrine; 31 promises freedom to those who believe; 33 answers the Jews that boasted of Abraham; 48 answers their reviling, by shewing his authority and dignity; 59 and conveys himself from their cruelty.</p>\n<p>Mt 21:1; Mr 11:1; 13:3; Lu 19:37</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-2","title":"John 8:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>early. 4:34; Ec 9:10; Jer 25:3; 44:4; Lu 21:37 and he. Mt 5:1,2; 26:55; Lu 4:20; 5:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-5","title":"John 8:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Moses. Le 20:10; De 22:21-24; Eze 16:38-40; 23:47 but. Mt 5:17; 19:6-8; 22:16-18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-6","title":"John 8:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>tempting. Nu 14:22; Mt 19:3; Lu 10:25; 11:53,54; 20:20-23; 1Co 10:9 But. 2; Ge 49:9; Jer 17:13; Da 5:5 as though. Ps 38:12-14; 39:1; Pr 26:17; Ec 3:7; Am 5:10,13; Mt 10:16; 15:23 Mt 26:63</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-7","title":"John 8:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>and said. 7:46; Pr 12:18; 26:4,5; Jer 23:29; 1Co 14:24,25; Col 4:6 Heb 4:12,13; Re 1:16; 2:16; 19:15 He that. De 17:6; Ps 50:16-20; Mt 7:1-5; 23:25-28; Ro 2:1-3,21-25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-9","title":"John 8:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>being. Ge 42:21,22; 1Ki 2:44; 17:18; Ps 50:21; Ec 7:22; Mr 6:14-16 Lu 12:1-3; Ro 2:15,22; 1Jo 3:20 went out. Job 5:12,13; 20:5,27; Ps 9:15,16; 40:14; 71:13; Lu 13:17 alone. 2,10,12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-10","title":"John 8:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>where. Isa 41:11,12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-11","title":"John 8:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>Neither. 15; 3:17; 18:36; De 16:18; 17:9; Lu 9:56; 12:13,14; Ro 13:3,4 1Co 5:12 go. 5:14; Job 34:31; Pr 28:13; Isa 1:16-18; 55:6; Eze 18:30-32 Mt 21:28-31; Lu 5:32; 13:3,5; 15:7,10,32; Ro 2:4; 5:20,21 1Ti 1:15,16; 2Pe 3:15; Re 2:21,22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-12","title":"John 8:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>I am. 1:4-9; 3:19; 9:5; 12:35; Isa 9:2; 42:6,7; 49:6; 60:1-3; Ho 6:3; Mal 4:2 Mt 4:14-16; Lu 1:78,79; 2:32; Ac 13:47; 26:23 shall not. 12:35,46; Ps 18:28; 97:11; Isa 50:10; 2Pe 2:4,17; Jude 1:6,13 shall have. 7:17; 14:6; Job 33:28; Ps 49:19; Re 21:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-13","title":"John 8:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>Thou. 5:31-47</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-14","title":"John 8:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>yet. Nu 12:3; Ne 5:14-19; 2Co 11:31; 12:11,19 for. 42; 7:29; 10:15,36; 13:3; 14:10; 16:28; 17:8 but. 7:27,28; 9:29,30</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-15","title":"John 8:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>judge. 7:24; 1Sa 16:7; Ps 58:1,2; 94:20,21; Am 5:7; 6:12; Hab 1:4; Ro 2:1 1Co 2:15; 4:3-5; Jas 2:4 I judge. 11; 3:17; 12:47;