d":"tsk-jhn-8-22","title":"John 8:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>Will. 48,52; 7:20; 10:20; Ps 22:6; 31:18; 123:4; Heb 12:3; 13:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-23","title":"John 8:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>Ye are from. 1:14; 3:13,31; Ps 17:4; Ro 8:7,8; 1Co 15:47,48; Php 3:19-21 Jas 3:15-17; 1Jo 2:15,16 ye are of. 15:18,19; 17:14,16; Jas 4:4; 1Jo 2:15,16; 4:5,6; 5:19,20</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-24","title":"John 8:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>I said. 21 for. 3:18,36; Pr 8:36; Mr 16:16; Ac 4:12; Heb 2:3; 10:26-29; 12:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-25","title":"John 8:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>Who. 1:19,22; 10:24; 19:9; Lu 22:67 Even. 12; 5:17-29</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-26","title":"John 8:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>have many. 16:12; Heb 5:11,12 to judge. 16; 5:42,43; 9:39-41; 12:47-50 but. 17; 7:28; 2Co 1:18 and I. 40; 3:32; 7:16; 15:15; 17:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-27","title":"John 8:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>43,47; Isa 6:9; 42:18-20; 59:10; Ro 11:7-10; 2Co 4:3,4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-28","title":"John 8:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>When. 3:14; 12:32-34; 19:18 then. Mt 27:50-54; Ac 2:41; 4:4; Ro 1:4; 1Th 2:15,16 and that. 5:19,30; 6:38; 11:42; 12:49,50; Nu 16:28-30; Heb 2:2,3 but. 3:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-29","title":"John 8:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>he that sent. 16; 14:10,11; 16:32; Isa 42:1,6; 49:4-8; 50:4-9; 2Ti 4:17,22 for. 4:34; 5:30; 6:38; 14:31; 15:10; 17:4; Isa 42:1,21; Mt 3:17; 17:5 Heb 4:15; 5:8,9; 7:26; 10:5-10; 1Jo 2:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-30","title":"John 8:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>many. 2:23; 6:14; 7:31; 10:42; 11:45</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-31","title":"John 8:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>If. 6:66-71; 15:4-9; 1Sa 12:14; Mt 24:13; Ac 13:43; 14:22; 26:22; Ro 2:7 Ro 11:22; Col 1:23; 1Ti 2:15; 4:16; 2Ti 3:14; Heb 3:14; 8:9; 10:38,39 Jas 1:25; 1Jo 2:19,24 my disciples. 36; 1:47; 6:55; 15:8; 1Ti 5:3-5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-32","title":"John 8:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>ye shall. 6:45; 7:17; 14:6; 16:13; Ps 25:5,8,9; Pr 1:23,29; 2:1-7; 4:18 So 1:7,8; Isa 2:3; 30:21; 35:8; 54:13; Jer 6:16; 31:33,34; Ho 6:3 Mal 4:2; Mt 11:29; 13:11,12; 2Ti 3:7 and the. 36; 17:17; Ps 119:45; Isa 61:1; Ro 6:14-18,22; 8:2,15; 2Co 3:17,18 Ga 5:13; 2Ti 2:25,26; Jas 1:25; 2:12; 1Pe 2:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-33","title":"John 8:33","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>We be. 39; Le 25:42; Mt 3:9; Lu 16:24-26 and were. 19:25; Ge 15:13; Ex 1:13,14; Jud 2:18; 3:8; 4:3; Ezr 9:9; Ne 5:4-8 Ne 9:27,28,36,37</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-34","title":"John 8:34","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":34,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":34},"content":"<p>Verily. 3:3; Mt 5:18 Whosoever. 1Ki 21:25; Pr 5:22; Ac 8:23; Ro 6:6,12,16,19,20; 7:14,25; 8:21 Eph 2:2; Tit 3:3; 2Pe 2:19; 1Jo 3:8-10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-35","title":"John 8:35","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":35,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":35},"content":"<p>the servant. Ge 21:10; Eze 46:17; Mt 21:41-43; Ga 4:30,31 but. 14:19,20; Ro 8:15-17,29,30; Ga 4:4-7; Col 3:3; Heb 3:5,6; 1Pe 1:2-5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-36","title":"John 8:36","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":36,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":36},"content":"<p>31,32; Ps 19:13; 119:32,133; Isa 49:24,25; 61:1; Zec 9:11,12 Lu 4:18; Ro 8:2; 2Co 3:17; Ga 5:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-37","title":"John 8:37","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":37,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":37},"content":"<p>know. 33; Ac 13:26; Ro 9:7 but. 6,40,59; 5:16-18; 7:1,19,25; 10:31; 11:53 because. 43,45-47; 5:44; 12:39-43; Mt 13:15,19-22; 1Co 2:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-38","title":"John 8:38","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":38,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":38},"content":"<p>speak. 26; 3:32; 5:19,30; 12:49,50; 14:10,24; 17:8 and ye. 41,44; Mt 3:7; 1Jo 3:8-10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-39","title":"John 8:39","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":39,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":39},"content":"<p>Abraham. 33 If. 37; Mt 3:9; 5:45; Ro 2:28,29; 4:12,16; 9:7; Ga 3:7,29; Jas 2:22-24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-40","title":"John 8:40","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":40,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":40},"content":"<p>now. 37; Ps 37:12,32; Ga 4:16,29; 1Jo 3:12-15; Re 12:4,12,13,17 a man. 26,38,56 this. Ro 4:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-41","title":"John 8:41","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":41,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":41},"content":"<p>do. 38,44 We be. Isa 57:3-7; Eze 23:45-47; Ho 1:2; 2:2-5; Mal 2:11 we have. Ex 4:22; De 14:1; Isa 63:16; 64:8; Jer 3:19; 31:20; Eze 16:20,21 Mal 1:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-42","title":"John 8:42","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":42,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":42},"content":"<p>If. 5:23; 15:23,24; Mal 1:6; 1Co 16:22; 1Jo 5:1,2 for. 1:14; 16:27,28; 17:8,25; Re 22:1 neither. 5:43; 7:28,29; 12:49; 14:10; 17:8,25; Ga 4:4; 1Jo 4:9,10,14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-43","title":"John 8:43","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":43,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":43},"content":"<p>do. 27; 5:43; 7:17; 12:39,40; Pr 28:5; Isa 44:18; Ho 14:9; Mic 4:12 Ro 3:11 ye cannot. 6:60; Isa 6:9; Jer 6:10; Ac 7:51; Ro 8:7,8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-44","title":"John 8:44","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":44,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":44},"content":"<p>are. 38,41; 6:70; Ge 3:15; Mt 13:38; Ac 13:10; 1Jo 3:8-10,12 He was. Ge 3:3-7; 1Ki 22:22; 1Ch 21:1; Jas 4:1-7; 1Pe 5:8; Re 2:10; 9:11 Re 13:6-8; 20:7-9 and abode. 2Pe 2:4; Jude 1:6 When. Ge 3:4,5; 2Ch 18:20-22; Job 1:11; 2:4-6; Ac 5:3; 13:10; 2Co 11:3 2Co 11:13-15; 2Th 2:9-11; Re 12:9; 13:14; 20:2,3,10; 21:8; 22:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-45","title":"John 8:45","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":45,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":45},"content":"<p>3:19,20; 7:7; Ga 4:16; 2Th 2:10; 2Ti 4:3,4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-46","title":"John 8:46","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":46,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":46},"content":"<p>convinceth. 7; 14:30; 15:10; 16:8; 2Co 5:21; Heb 4:15; 7:26; 1Pe 2:22 why. Mt 21:25; Mr 11:31</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-47","title":"John 8:47","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":47,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":47},"content":"<p>37,43,45; 1:12,13; 6:45,46,65; 10:26,27; 17:6-8; 1Jo 3:10; 4:1-6; 5:1 2Jo 1:9; 3Jo 1:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-48","title":"John 8:48","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":48,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":48},"content":"<p>Say. 52; 13:13; Mt 15:7; Jas 2:19 thou. 4:9; 7:20; 10:20; Isa 49:7; 53:3; Mt 10:25; 12:24,31; Ro 15:3 Heb 13:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-49","title":"John 8:49","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":49,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":49},"content":"<p>I have not. Pr 26:4,5; 1Pe 2:23 but. 29; 11:4; 12:28; 13:31,32; 14:13; 17:4; Isa 42:21; 49:3; Mt 3:15-17 Php 2:6-11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-50","title":"John 8:50","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":50,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":50},"content":"<p>I seek not. 5:41; 7:18 there. 5:20-23,45; 12:47,48</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-51","title":"John 8:51","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":51,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":51},"content":"<p>If. 3:15,16; 5:24; 6:50; 11:25,26 keep. 55; 15:20 see. 12; Ps 89:48; Lu 2:26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-52","title":"John 8:52","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":52,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":52},"content":"<p>Now. 48; 9:24 Abraham. Zec 1:5,6; Heb 11:13 taste. Heb 2:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-53","title":"John 8:53","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":53,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":53},"content":"<p>thou greater. 58; 4:12; 10:29,30; 12:34; Isa 9:6; Mt 12:6,41,42; Ro 9:5; Heb 3:2,3 Heb 7:1-7 whom. 5:18; 10:33; 19:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-54","title":"John 8:54","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":54,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":54},"content":"<p>If. 50; 2:11; 5:31,32; 7:18; Pr 25:27; 2Co 10:18; Heb 5:4,5 it is. 5:22-29,41; 7:39; 13:31,32; 16:14,15; 17:1,5; Ps 2:6-12; 110:1-4 Da 7:13,14; Ac 3:13; Eph 1:20-23; Php 2:9-11; 1Pe 1:12,21; 2Pe 1:17 ye say. 41; Isa 48:1,2; 66:5; Ho 1:9; Ro 2:17-29</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-55","title":"John 8:55","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":55,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":55},"content":"<p>ye have not. 19; 7:28,29; 15:21; 16:3; 17:25; Jer 4:22; 9:3; Ho 5:4; Ac 17:23 2Co 4:6 but. 1:18; 6:46; 7:29; 10:15; Mt 11:27; Lu 10:22 shall. 44; 1Jo 2:4,22; 5:10; Re 3:9 and keep. 29,51</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-56","title":"John 8:56","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":56,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":56},"content":"<p>rejoiced. Ge 22:18; Lu 2:28-30; 10:24; Ga 3:7-9; Heb 11:13,39; 1Pe 1:10-12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-58","title":"John 8:58","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":58,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":58},"content":"<p>Verily. 34,51 Before. 1:1,2; 17:5,24; Pr 8:22-30; Isa 9:6; Mic 5:2; Col 1:17; Heb 1:10-12 Heb 13:8; Re 1:11,17,18; 2:8 I am.That our Lord by this expression asserted his divinity and eternal existence, as the great I AM, appears evident from the use of the present tense, instead of the past tense, from its being in answer to the Jews, who enquired whether he had seen Abraham, and from its being thus understood by the multitude, who were exasperated at it to such a degree that they took up stones to stone him. The ancient Jews not only believed that the Messiah was superior to and Lord of all the patriarchs, and even of angels, but that his celestial nature existed with God from whom it emanated, before the creation, and that the creation was effected by his ministry.</p>\n<p>Ex 3:14; Isa 43:13; 44:6,8; 46:9; 48:12; Re 1:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-jhn-8-59","title":"John 8:59","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"JHN","chapterStart":8,"verseStart":59,"chapterEnd":8,"verseEnd":59},"content":"<p>took. 5,6; 10:30-33; 11:8; 18:31; Le 24:16; Lu 4:29; Ac 7:57 but. 5:13; 10:39,40; 11:54; Ge 19:11; 2Ki 6:18-20; Lu 4:30; 24:31 Ac 8:39,40</p>"}]}